  "body": "Previously it returned a HTMLFormControlsCollection, but this was unnecessarily complicated. Gecko implements HTMLCollection, and Edge does not implement this property, so we are reasonably sure that this simplification is web-compatible.\n\nThis is a pretty straightforward three-line change. @bzbarsky, can you confirm it is indeed this simple?\n",
